      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The significance of genetic factors contributing to the complex etiology of coronary heart disease is discussed using lipoprotein metabolism as an example. A radiochemical screening method was developed fro precise biochemical diagnosis of autosomal monogenic hypercholesterolemia. In this method lymphocytes are used as test material."},
